    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"air changing\" just sounds like a way to describe the impact. it doesn't feel like a pivot, it feels like a wreck. if i keep going like this, i'm just going to be this pathetic person begging for help, losing my house, losing everything i used to be. it feels like there's no way to keep my dignity once the crash is complete. is there even a way to keep any kind of respect once you've lost everything?",
